Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8

<!-- SYNTHETIC PAGE: written for the broken_link_check tests (issue #164). This page was never fetched from its stated URL. Every link target below is real, and each target's response is a real capture in this folder. -->
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head><title>Synthetic page with a dead link</title></head>
<body>
<p><a href="https://example.com/">Example Domain, live</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.iana.org/domains/example">IANA example domains, redirects</a></p>
<p><a href="https://example.com/no-such-page-broken-link-check">A dead link</a></p>
<p><a href="no-such-page-broken-link-check">The same dead link, written relative</a></p>
<p><a href="https://example.com/">Example Domain again, a duplicate</a></p>
<p><a href="mailto:someone@example.com">Mail, not an HTTP link</a></p>
<p><a href="#top">Back to top, a same page anchor</a></p>
</body>
</html>
